= The new future arises

...

The neverending crowd of mumbling social democrats, union members, Reichsbanner units and our allies. The world's horizon opens upon me. On top of the stadium stands **Carlo Mierendorff**, our bravest member, one of the organizers of Iron Front and recently has been appointed one of main ideologues following Hilferding's reputation collapse. Centrists have for long been ousted and their power has diminished over the time with the new influx of youth.

The roar of the neorevisionism. The scream of the energized crowd. Mierendorff yells: "This future of the social democracy lies in it's reenergization, naturalization amongst the minds of the German collective, community, people. The bureaucratic mind of the party has never understood this. The ever-lustful labor never have eyed beyond it's wealth and weight. The left has been all but true action. State-politicians been greedy for too long. Listen to me, people of Germany. This day, we will denounce MAR-"

